the target language is: prolog.

the functions are:
    the age is *a number*.
    the risk category is *a text*.
    the is_affordable is *a truth value*.
    the approval status is *a text*.
    the risk category or null is *a text*.

the templates are:
    the approval status for *a number* and *a text* and *a truth value* is *a value* under table approval_status.

the table approval_status is, with unique match:
    age   | risk category     | is_affordable | value
    >= 18 | "Medium" or "Low" | true          | "Approved"
    < 18  | "Medium" or "Low" | true          | "Declined"
    any   | "High"            | true          | "Declined"
    any   | any               | false         | "Declined"

the knowledge base n0004_simpletable_u includes:

the text of the_model is at "sources/0004-simpletable-U.dmn".

the risk category or null is the risk category, as stated in the model at decision Approval Status.

rule approval_status_2 with provenance the model at decision Approval Status:
the risk category or null is null if
    it is not the case that the risk category is a text.

rule approval_status_3 with provenance the model at decision Approval Status:
the approval status is a text if
    the approval status for the age and the risk category or null and the is_affordable is the text under table approval_status.

scenario t001 is, as stated in "0004-simpletable-U-test-01.xml" at test case 001:
    the age is 18.
    the risk category is "Medium".
    the is_affordable is true.
    q_d_approval_status expects answers ["the approval status is Approved"].

scenario t002 is, as stated in "0004-simpletable-U-test-01.xml" at test case 002:
    the age is 17.
    the risk category is "Medium".
    the is_affordable is true.
    q_d_approval_status expects answers ["the approval status is Declined"].

scenario t003 is, as stated in "0004-simpletable-U-test-01.xml" at test case 003:
    the age is 18.
    the risk category is "High".
    the is_affordable is true.
    q_d_approval_status expects answers ["the approval status is Declined"].

query q_d_approval_status is:
    the approval status is which text.

